{
  "id": "tricky-critical-dice",
  "title": "Tricky Critical Dice",
  "description": "A house rule for critical hits in dnd5e: after a crit's damage dice are rolled, the two dice with the most to gain are maximized. Selection is by potential gain, not by lowest roll - a 5 on a d12 beats a 1 on a d4. The real dice still roll and stay visible; the upgrade is added as an explicit bonus.",
